        "original_id": "1b7dad89-e9f5-5546-9e44-9726fa32b7ce",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ivor Gurney, Robert Walser, Iain Burnside\n- Works: A Soldier and a Maker\n- Topics: poetry, composition, musical theatre, writing\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Walser was born on 15 April 1878 and was a German-speaking Swiss writer.\n- Ivor Gurney was born on 28 August 1890 and was an English poet and composer, especially of songs.\n- A Soldier and a Maker is a piece of musical theatre by Iain Burnside about the life of First World War poet and composer Ivor Gurney.\n- Ivor Gurney died on 26 December 1937.\n- Robert Walser died on 25 December 1956.",
